   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why providers: OpenAI, Supabase and Colab are optional. Without keys the platform\nruns offline (SQLite + local disk + rules + CPU) in two commands. Swapping a\nservice = one new provider class.",
   "originalText": "Why providers: OpenAI, Supabase and Colab are optional. Without keys the platform\nruns offline (SQLite + local disk + rules + CPU) in two commands. Swapping a\nservice = one new provider class.",
