   "text": "① per clip: trim · scale/crop to 16:9, 9:16, 1:1 or 4:5 · 30 fps · clip\nvolume (auto / manual / mute)\n② concat (hard cuts) or xfade + acrossfade (0.3 / 0.6 s)\n③ title in the last N s · music: start offset, loop, duck to 20% under\ndialogue, fade-out, limiter",
   "originalText": "① per clip: trim · scale/crop to 16:9, 9:16, 1:1 or 4:5 · 30 fps · clip\nvolume (auto / manual / mute)\n② concat (hard cuts) or xfade + acrossfade (0.3 / 0.6 s)\n③ title in the last N s · music: start offset, loop, duck to 20% under\ndialogue, fade-out, limiter",
