   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Verified in real renders: the title shows only in the last 3 s · music loops and fades out · music ducks under the welcome line and\nthe speech carries it · 0 black frames · a 25 s cut renders in about 21–26 s plus 7–13 s upload · FFmpeg CPU is now metered (about 90\nCPU-seconds per render). Not tested: importing the EDL/FCPXML into DaVinci or Premiere.",
   "originalText": "Verified in real renders: the title shows only in the last 3 s · music loops and fades out · music ducks under the welcome line and\nthe speech carries it · 0 black frames · a 25 s cut renders in about 21–26 s plus 7–13 s upload · FFmpeg CPU is now metered (about 90\nCPU-seconds per render). Not tested: importing the EDL/FCPXML into DaVinci or Premiere.",
