   "text": "Metrics\ncorrect = ≥ 80% of the clip inside a correct take, or\ncorrectly reported missing\nspoken shot = the clip must contain the key line\npurity = share of the clip inside a correct take\nalso counted: bad takes, look-alikes, false positives,\nstart error of the spoken line",
