   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Read with care: the thresholds were tuned on the café footage, so\n8/8 is a best case. The practice clips were never used for tuning;\nthat 5/6 is the honest number. Also checked: the steady latte take\nbeat the handheld one; blurry and dark takes were never chosen; no\nlook-alike was chosen.",
   "originalText": "Read with care: the thresholds were tuned on the café footage, so\n8/8 is a best case. The practice clips were never used for tuning;\nthat 5/6 is the honest number. Also checked: the steady latte take\nbeat the handheld one; blurry and dark takes were never chosen; no\nlook-alike was chosen.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
